title: Zettelkasten

Questions to ask of any note:

* In which circumstances will I want to stumble across this note?
* How and when will I use this idea?

The notecard: a way to group useful notes and ideas.

Questions about the card itself:

* what if I had to do all of this manually?
* what if I was actually pinning physical cards together?
* why maintain a connection to the physical?
* what is a better digital name for "card"?

Relevant notes: [[Everything Is Connected]], [[ZettleKasten tour]]

